Cell["\<\
MyWork.nb ---- \
Get[\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MyPackage.m\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]] ----> \
MyPackage.m
(interactive)                           (package)

Query              | Inside MyWork.nb  | Inside MyPackage.m (during Get)
-------------------|-------------------|--------------------------------
InputNotebook[]    | MyWork.nb  [OK]   | MyWork.nb  [OK]  (focus is still \
there)
EvaluationNotebook[]| MyWork.nb  [OK]  | also MyWork.nb  [OK]

NOTE: during Get[\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MyPackage.m\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]], \
both return MyWork.nb, because the
evaluation was initiated from a cell in MyWork.nb. The package file
itself is not a notebook object -- it has no NotebookObject.\
\>", "Text",
 InitializationCell->
  True,ExpressionUUID->"41570a48-f582-c645-962d-6761dff5836e"],

